title: PlaceholderTopic8
when: IsCurrentActor("Munir")
---
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: You move slow for someone your size.
<<SetShot "OTS_A">>

Munir: Slow keeps things intact.
Prince: Ever want to move fast?
Munir: I used to.
Prince: What stopped you?
Munir: Learning where fast leads.
Prince: And you liked the view?
Munir: Enough to stay.
